      <pattern name="Staged resumable job" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/Handlers/InvoiceSubmissionProcessingJobHandler.cs">Lock, re-read, terminal-first check, resume from stored stage, final-delivery mapping to JobOutcome. Copy the rules, not the invoice types.</pattern>
      <pattern name="Handler registration" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/DI/JobProcessingModule.cs">`services.AddScoped&lt;IJobHandler, …&gt;()` with a comment naming ADR-052 placement.</pattern>
